  "description": "Transport-agnostic contracts for connection-oriented messaging: session lifecycle (ISession with DisconnectReason), IByteChannel/IMessageChannel abstractions, length-prefix framing, and a message pipeline (converter/handler over IBufferWriter/Span) with per-send SendOptions. All TCP/RUDP transports in the DS_Communication family build on these contracts. Targets .NET Standard 2.1 — runs on modern .NET and Unity.",
